note Greeting everyone in their own language.
note
note `show text Hi` puts the word Hi in the program. A message puts the *idea*
note in the program and lets the running application choose the wording, so this
note file and greeting.he.shark and greeting.ja.shark are all the same program with
note the same canonical hash. See spec/04-multilingual.md section 4.12.

the message greeting says
  in english Hi
  in hebrew שלום
  in japanese こんにちは

show text value of greeting
